{"ID":"20240205153807-4hpp99c","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153807-4hpp99c","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153807-4hpp99c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206083333-pbjovby\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607101427-mtq9k0a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2800,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240618140847-6vajw9t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:5,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:5\u0026#125;","title":"033独活（羌活）","type":"doc","updated":"20240913160607"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240802130007-n80fwiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802130007-n80fwiq","updated":"20240802130007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"独活（重齿毛当归）"}]},{"ID":"20240206083333-pbjovby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083333-pbjovby","updated":"20240206083337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、湖北等地。\n【性状】\t根头及主根粗短，略呈圆柱形，长1.54cm，直径1.53.5cm，下部有数条弯曲的支根，长1230cm，直径0.51.5cm。表面粗糙，灰棕色，具不规则纵皱纹及横裂纹，并有多数横长皮孔及细根痕；根头部有环纹，具多殖环状叶柄痕，中内为凹陷的茎痕。质坚硬，断面灰黄白色，形成层环棕色，皮部有棕色油点 (油管)，木部黄棕色；根头横断面有大形贿部，亦有油点。香气特异，味苦辛，微麻舌。"}]},{"ID":"20240206083341-hu9qo3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083341-hu9qo3u"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】\t辛、苦，微温。\n【功效】\t祛风胜湿；散寒止痛。用于风寒湿痹；腰膝疼痛；少阴伏风头痛，头痛齿痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206083324-hvgdhd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083324-hvgdhd5","updated":"20240206083324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206083324-fo7gmk1.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160828-icxz42f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties"